<% layout("/layouts/boilerplate") %>

<link rel="stylesheet" href="/css/about.css">

<section class="about-page-section" id="about">

    <div class="about-page-container">

        <!-- LEFT CONTENT -->
        <div class="about-page-content">

            <span class="about-page-tag">
                ABOUT STUDENTSTAY
            </span>

            <h1>
                Simplifying Student Living,
                <span>One Stay at a Time.</span>
            </h1>

            <p class="about-page-lead">
                StudentStay is a student-focused accommodation and
                service platform designed to make finding, comparing,
                and managing student living spaces easier, safer,
                and more convenient.
            </p>

            <p>
                Moving to a new city for education often comes with
                challenges such as finding affordable accommodation,
                verifying property information, understanding rental
                terms, and arranging essential services. StudentStay
                brings these requirements together in one centralized
                platform.
            </p>

            <p>
                Students can explore suitable hostels, PGs, rooms,
                and other accommodation options based on their
                requirements and budget. Along with accommodation,
                the platform connects students with essential
                services such as mess, laundry, and vehicle facilities.
            </p>

            <p>
                Our goal is to create a reliable digital ecosystem
                where students can make informed accommodation
                decisions while property owners and service providers
                can reach their target audience more effectively.
            </p>

            <a href="/listings" class="about-page-btn">
                Explore Accommodation
                <span>&rarr;</span>
            </a>

        </div>


